      "source_xml_line": 317,
      "string_id": "mil_cook_drunk_question_about_rg6_1_0",
      "occurrence": 1,
      "EN": "I heard something about Freedom having an impressive grenade launcher. Sure would be fun to take a look at that baby.",
      "JA_current": "Freedom が Bulldog 6 を持っているという噂を耳にした。ぜひ、そのベイビーにお目にかかりたいんだが。",
      "JA_new": "フリーダムがすごいグレネードランチャーを持ってるって聞いた。あれを見られたら楽しそうだな。",
      "review_notes": null,
      "english_reference_status": "same_table_and_id_occurrence",
      "review_flags": [],
      "graph_uses": [
        {
          "dialog_id": "mil_cook_drunk_question_about_rg6_1",
          "phrase_id": "0",
          "graph_source": "gamedata/config/gameplay/dialogs_military.xml"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "key": "stable_dialogs_military:mil_cook_drunk_question_about_rg6_1_1#1",
      "source_table": "stable_dialogs_military",
      "source_file": "F:\\Games\\Radiophobia 3\\gamedata\\config\\text\\jpn\\stable_dialogs_military.xml",
      "source_xml_line": 320,
      "string_id": "mil_cook_drunk_question_about_rg6_1_1",
      "occurrence": 1,
      "EN": "What are you getting at, man? You want me to... to give you... to spill the beans?.. What kind of fool do you take me for?",
      "JA_current": "何を言ってるんだ、アンタ？ 俺に… 話せと… 洗いざらい話せと…？ 馬鹿にしてんのか？",
      "JA_new": "何が言いたいんだ？俺に……情報を吐かせたいのか？俺をどんな間抜けだと思ってる？",
      "review_notes": null,
      "english_reference_status": "same_table_and_id_occurrence",
      "review_flags": [],
      "graph_uses": [
        {
          "dialog_id": "mil_cook_drunk_question_about_rg6_1",
          "phrase_id": "1",
          "graph_source": "gamedata/config/gameplay/dialogs_military.xml"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "key": "stable_dialogs_military:mil_cook_drunk_question_about_rg6_1_2#1",
      "source_table": "stable_dialogs_military",
      "source_file": "F:\\Games\\Radiophobia 3\\gamedata\\config\\text\\jpn\\stable_dialogs_military.xml",
      "source_xml_line": 323,
      "string_id": "mil_cook_drunk_question_about_rg6_1_2",
      "occurrence": 1,
      "EN": "Calm down. I didn't know it was that serious.",
      "JA_current": "落ち着け。そんなに重大だとは知らなかったんだ。",
      "JA_new": "落ち着けよ。そんなに大ごとだとは知らなかった。",
      "review_notes": null,
      "english_reference_status": "same_table_and_id_occurrence",
      "review_flags": [],
      "graph_uses": [
        {
          "dialog_id": "mil_cook_drunk_question_about_rg6_1",
          "phrase_id": "2",
          "graph_source": "gamedata/config/gameplay/dialogs_military.xml"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "key": "stable_dialogs_military:mil_cook_drunk_question_about_rg6_1_3#1",
      "source_table": "stable_dialogs_military",
      "source_file": "F:\\Games\\Radiophobia 3\\gamedata\\config\\text\\jpn\\stable_dialogs_military.xml",
      "source_xml_line": 326,
      "string_id": "mil_cook_drunk_question_about_rg6_1_3",
      "occurrence": 1,
      "EN": "You don't go snooping around for our weapons, got that? Who the hell are you, anyway? I've never seen you before!",
      "JA_current": "俺たちの兵器を探しまわるな、分かったか？ 一体、アンタ誰だ？ いままで会ったこともないだろ！",
      "JA_new": "武器を探りに来るな。分かったか？そもそもお前は誰だ？見たことないぞ！",
      "review_notes": null,
      "english_reference_status": "same_table_and_id_occurrence",
      "review_flags": [],
      "graph_uses": [
        {
          "dialog_id": "mil_cook_drunk_question_about_rg6_1",
